<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Mini IDP - 统一认证中心</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>
  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Mini IDP 统一认证中心</h1>
      <p>基于 Node.js + Express + EJS 实现的标准 OAuth 2.0 授权服务，支持 PKCE（S256）。</p>
      <div class="badges">
        <span class="badge">授权码模式</span>
        <span class="badge">PKCE (S256)</span>
        <span class="badge mono">GET /oauth/authorize</span>
        <span class="badge mono">POST /oauth/token</span>
        <span class="badge mono">GET /oauth/userinfo</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>已注册的接入应用</h2>
      <table class="tbl">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>应用</th><th>client_id</th><th>类型</th><th>redirect_uri</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <% clients.forEach(function (c) { %>
          <tr>
            <td><%= c.name %></td>
            <td class="mono"><%= c.client_id %></td>
            <td><%= c.client_secret ? '机密客户端（有 client_secret）' : '公共客户端（仅 PKCE）' %></td>
            <td class="mono"><%= c.redirect_uris.join('<br>') %></td>
          </tr>
          <% }); %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>演示账号</h2>
      <p class="mono">alice / 123456　　bob / 654321</p>
      <p class="muted">Web 应用跑在 :3001，CLI 应用跑在 :3002。登录后即可为接入应用完成授权。</p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
